link
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
[Rhythmic music, impacts and audio demos]
AN X LINK
Paste a public X link and import its video to create your sticker.

animation
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
ANIMATED STICKER
Choose the moment with the trim handles and turn it into a looping animated sticker.

original
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:22.000
ORIGINAL SOUND
The video’s sound is selected on import. Hear the cat typing on the keyboard.

second
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:30.000
TWO SOUNDS
Add audio from a file, a link or your microphone. The second track follows the first.

excerpt
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.000
YOUR EXCERPT
Drag the selection to choose your audio excerpt, even five seconds into the source.

export
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:40.000
SAVE IT
Save your animation as a GIF or download an MP4 video with audio.

outro
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:44.000
CREATE WITH ZAPSTICK
An X link, an animation, your sounds: create your next sticker on Zapstick.
